<title>CHINA: China Jiangsu's 453,000 ha of cotton growing well.</title>
<headline>China Jiangsu's 453,000 ha of cotton growing well.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's eastern Jiangsu province has planted 453,000 hectares of cotton this year, of which 70 percent has already sprouted cotton bolls, six to eight days earlier than usual, the People's Daily said on Monday.</p>
<p>However, the area under cotton was down by 32,000 hectares compared with last year, it said without giving further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
</text>
